]. Specifically speaking, phosphorylated STAT3 leads to the initiation of lung fibrosis. Cyclic RNA 406,961 (circ_406961) interacts with interleukin enhancer-binding factor 2 (ILF2) to regulate STAT3 and mitogen-activated protein kinase 8 (MAPK8, JNK) to inhibit the activation of the STAT3/JNK pathway, thereby suppressing the PM2.5-induced inflammatory response and attenuating pulmonary fibrosis [
